*> the world and local forms and the mixed error (§8.1 to §8.3), the types block_pos, column_pos, vec3, vec2 and rotation with
*> their incomplete errors and the centre correction of vec3 x and z (§8.2, §8.4), angle (§8.5) and swizzle (§8.6). One literal
*> per type; the result reads "ok v[start,end]" and the components "a<n>" absolute, "r<n>" relative, "l<n>" local (angle one
*> component; swizzle "i=" the axis set x 1, y 2, z 4) or "err <key>|<args>@<cursor>".
