       10 WS-CASE-LINE PIC X(300).
       10 WS-CASE-EXPECTED PIC X(200).
 01 WS-LINE                PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-LENGTH              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LEVEL               BINARY-LONG VALUE 4.
 01 WS-VERDICT             BINARY-LONG.
