 01 WS-KIND-DOUBLE         BINARY-LONG VALUE 2.
 01 WS-ZERO-INF            BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-NODE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CHILD               BINARY-LONG.
